{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TrillionniumFoundation/trillionnium-os-desktop/pulls/157","id":4899324174,"node_id":"PR_kwDOVLzC488AAAABJAXBDg","html_url":"https://github.com/TrillionniumFoundation/trillionnium-os-desktop/pull/157","diff_url":"https://github.com/TrillionniumFoundation/trillionnium-os-desktop/pull/157.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/TrillionniumFoundation/trillionnium-os-desktop/pull/157.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TrillionniumFoundation/trillionnium-os-desktop/issues/157","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TrillionniumFoundation/trillionnium-os-desktop/pulls/157/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TrillionniumFoundation/trillionnium-os-desktop/pulls/157/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TrillionniumFoundation/trillionnium-os-desktop/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TrillionniumFoundation/trillionnium-os-desktop/issues/157/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TrillionniumFoundation/trillionnium-os-desktop/statuses/89aa8fa62d30b00259cb33174260c134edf1a70b","number":157,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"feat(A07/A10): native CJK desktop, Hepta observer and original Agentd gates","user":{"login":"Franksudoman","id":273670192,"node_id":"U_kgDOEE_gMA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/273670192?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Franksudoman","html_url":"https://github.com/Franksudoman","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Franksudoman/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Franksudoman/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Franksudoman/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Franksudoman/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Franksudoman/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Franksudoman/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Franksudoman/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Franksudoman/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Franksudoman/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## 本轮进展（2026-10-17 22:38 UTC 快照）\n\n本 PR 保留 A10 owner `45552fbd8f79ea713509908ac4b08a3fd44a95bc` 的历史，并普通合入最新 main `f64c3d6be4d66b4840a19d6d25b6403198f4ec59`。当前候选 `84e08165d2e753fe1fc780e1972dbab4317e8499` 与本地 `3d29e6f304d263dd472a7739e24e83841f37066f` 完整 tree 同为 `e55a0e15e01f55f98f0a9213e67d2a5792776764`。\n\n本轮要补齐原版 Hepta Agentd → 持续 Session worker → 同一 Rust Shell 窗口的六阶段只读运行证据。**截至本快照，新的原版 native link 和 Shell 修复回归已经实际通过，持续 Session 探针正在编译，六阶段真实窗口运行尚未执行。** Draft 不代表生产设备或移动端已放行。\n\n### 已实现与实际验证\n\n- 新增原版库探针，保持原有 8 项 Agentd acceptance 独立；另验证持续 Session 的 Starting、Running、Draining、同 worker/instance、旧 spawn stale 但 IPC 响应、显式新 Session、replacement Running、停止后 stale 但 IPC 响应。Shell harness 对六阶段分别保存实际 Session 前后读数与 PNG；阶段 ACK 只协调运行，不替代像素核验。\n- **原版 x86_64 Agentd 真实链接通过。** 固定 Hepta `f8c9419df6ddeb36ff8b522a50219981fb8d9345`、原版锁和源码不变；最终 ELF 329,001,344 字节，SHA256 `f476f9bb435c5127839c48ae7135d5a6fa7695ff5253460fdd8d19d7b084d4fa`。两次失败构建、两次失败缓存迁移和最后成功恢复均原样保留；成功是同一已准入 target 的恢复执行，不是冷构建或重新执行 stock fresh-work gate。[原始构建与完整缓存清单](https://github.com/TrillionniumFoundation/trillionnium-os-desktop/blob/84e08165d2e753fe1fc780e1972dbab4317e8499/tests/integration/hepta/evidence/2026-10-17-native-agentd-build/README.md)\n- **修复 Shell 可见状态的新鲜度缺陷。** 旧接收路径会把刚到达的过期样本重新显示成 OBSERVED。实际 RED 运行 6 项测试，1 passed / 5 预期失败；最终 GREEN 重新编译源码 `84f0070b`（同树远端 `88e9cdb124801c1d0fba5d2bb7e52a85a69a79f4`），6 项新鲜度 + 2 项布局、严格 Clippy、fmt 和四程序 workspace build 通过。接收时间与原始采样时间共同判定 7 秒期限，保留旧观测并显示 stale/unknown。首次 GREEN 的旧缓存误用、第二次 GREEN 的测试类型 lint 失败单独保留，不转记为通过。[修复前后实际回归](https://github.com/TrillionniumFoundation/trillionnium-os-desktop/blob/84e08165d2e753fe1fc780e1972dbab4317e8499/tests/ui/evidence/2026-10-17-observation-freshness/README.md)\n- **修复外部 probe 的锁文件不稳定。** exact `f0924a6e` 的 ARM CI 与本地 consumer 均实际遇到 metadata 后 `--locked` build 拒绝，运行尚未开始。只在外部 probe 根 manifest 省略完全相同且未使用的 SSH patch alias；原版 source/manifest/lock 不变。733 个 package 与实际 resolve graph 不变，连续两次真实 locked metadata 通过，17 项 Python 检查通过；真实 probe 编译正在继续。[技术说明](https://github.com/TrillionniumFoundation/trillionnium-os-desktop/blob/84e08165d2e753fe1fc780e1972dbab4317e8499/tests/integration/hepta/PROBE_LOCK_STABILITY.md)、[f092 原始失败 CI](https://github.com/TrillionniumFoundation/trillionnium-os-desktop/blob/84e08165d2e753fe1fc780e1972dbab4317e8499/tests/integration/hepta/evidence/2026-10-17-f092-ci/README.md)\n- **补录旧最终候选 c0 的真实 CI 完成。** A10 run `39044366490` 与 ARM run `39044366482` 已实际 success，日志、下载包和全部 7 个 ELF 的字节/架构核验已归档。A10 的 145 passed / 2 ignored、额外 6 项 process guard 和原版 ARM 8 项分别计数；A10 的 Hepta 数据源仍是 scripted fixture，原版 ARM 当时逐次调用新 CLI。[固定 c0 的完整归档](https://github.com/TrillionniumFoundation/trillionnium-os-desktop/blob/84e08165d2e753fe1fc780e1972dbab4317e8499/tests/integration/hepta/evidence/2026-10-17-candidate-ci/README.md)\n\n### 本轮冻结的执行来源\n\n| 切片 | 本地 HEAD / 同树远端 | 来源关系 |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 初始 R6 gate / harness | `9d2ef72a` / `f0924a6e` | native Agentd 构建、首次消费者失败绑定此源码 |\n| 锁修复后的第一轮原版 / 旧 UI | `c50d7b9b` / `028b664b4717c4dffc03dc638fa3e9a5d7a0b52a` | 保留旧 R5 四 ELF 和完全相同的 UI/observer 编译输入；运行尚未完成 |\n| 新鲜度修复后的第二轮 | `8c26e295` / `324b4ee21bc45118280c48fc935b8f6acbe0b46f` | UI 子树与实际 GREEN03 构建完全相同；运行尚未执行 |\n\n后续证据提交的 HEAD 不替换这些实际执行来源；新候选的 CI 必须单独看真实结果，不能继承 c0 的 success。\n\n### 保留的范围\n\n原版运行 gate 不提交 objective、不调用模型、不安装 issuer、不改 authority/operations owner、不执行设备效果。只读 profile 不是 OS sandbox。真实 Shell 的运行资格将限定于本任务的 Linux host / 私有 Xvfb / 软件渲染；尚未赋予物理输入/显示、GPU、Wayland text-input v3、Asterinas 或移动端资格。历史 XIM UI-05 的差异中文输入已通过，但候选窗偏离 caret 的问题仍保留。\n\n根 README 严格 0 字节；Asterinas、Hepta pins 不变。main 的 STATUS / INDEX / DESKTOP_UX 将在本轮实录完成后以单独文档 PR 更新，产品代码仍由本 Draft 交付。","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-10-17T10:30:26Z","updated_at":"2026-10-18T0